@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Requirement families to execution evidence
artifact "Approved FR / NFR and acceptance criteria" as Requirements
artifact "Implemented, required or explicitly deferred scope" as Scope
artifact "Test families\nAUTH / REPO / AUTHZ / STORE / GEXEC\nBROWSE / GITR / PAT / GITW / DB / UI\nSEC / OBS / FAIL / E2E / PERF / REG / ACC" as Cases
artifact "Individual test case and expected result" as Case
artifact "Recorded execution and actual result" as Run
artifact "WP-19 row-level traceability" as Mapping
Requirements --> Cases
Scope --> Cases : confirm applicability
Cases --> Case
Case --> Run
Run --> Mapping
Requirements --> Mapping
note bottom of Mapping : Coverage is not established by implementation alone
@enduml
